1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Moonbase Academy: your base, your decisions.
A mission trainer for ages 7–12.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Stored: 2.4 kWh. Needed: 3.6 kWh.
Empty storage cannot create energy.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
One extra solar array changes the result.
The base completes its 12-hour test.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Half air during shadow saves 1.5 kWh
and spends 0.20 kg from the oxygen tank.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Rehearse a 98-hour archived storm.
Protect the crew and finish a science task.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
NASA references drive the calculation.
Build. Predict. Test. Improve. Offline on iPhone and iPad.
